  "historyNote": "#4799, Interim, eff 8-22-90, exp. 6-1-90; ss by #4954, eff 10-16-90; ss by #6336, eff 9-24-96; ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23",
