  "prefLabel": "Rev 1601.01 Agency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1601.01 “Agency” means any:\n\n(a) Legislative body;\n\n(b) Department;\n\n(c) Commission;\n\n(d) Board;\n\n(e) Institution;\n\n(f) Bureau; or\n\n(g) Other entity under the authority of the state or federal government, and not otherwise specifically excluded by law as a state or federal entity.\n\nSource. #4799, Interim, eff 8-22-90, exp. 6-1-90; ss by #4954, eff 10-16-90; ss by #6336, eff 9-24-96; ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23",
